# AI Vault - environment variables template
# Copy this file to .env-ai (gitignored) and fill in ONLY if you need it.
# Never commit the actual .env-ai file.
#
# ============================================================================
# AUTHENTICATION: dung GOI SUBSCRIPTION, KHONG can API key
# ============================================================================
# Mac dinh, ca 3 CLI dang nhap bang TAI KHOAN SUBSCRIPTION cua ban - KHONG can
# dat API key nao trong file nay:
#
#   - Claude Code  : chay `claude`, go `/login` -> dang nhap Claude Pro/Max.
#                    KHONG dat ANTHROPIC_API_KEY - neu dat, Claude Code se tinh
#                    tien theo API thay vi dung goi subscription cua ban.
#   - Codex CLI    : chay `codex`, chon "Sign in with ChatGPT" (goi ChatGPT Plus/Pro).
#   - Gemini CLI   : chay `gemini`, dang nhap bang tai khoan Google.
#
# => Voi nguoi dung subscription: file nay co the de TRONG hoan toan.
#
# ---- Vault path override (optional) ----------------------------------------
# Default: $HOME/git/ai-obsidian-vault
# Doi neu ban clone vault sang vi tri khac.
# VAULT_PATH=

# ============================================================================
# CHI dien duoi day NEU ban dung pay-per-use API key thay vi subscription
# (da so nguoi dung KHONG can phan nay)
# ============================================================================
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ---- GitHub (optional - uu tien `gh auth login` thay vi token) -------------
# GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# ---- Optional local tooling ------------------------------------------------
# Neu ban chay Ollama local cho code assistance:
# OLLAMA_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:11434
